flowchart LR
    Session[Retained SOCK_DIAG session] --> Listener[Bounded LISTEN dump]
    Session --> Exact[Exact established-socket query]
    Listener --> Parser[Strict netlink parser]
    Exact --> Parser
    Parser --> Cookie[Retain kernel socket cookie]
    Cookie --> ProcFd[Bracket visible same-UID holder scan]
    ProcFd --> Recheck[Exact query with retained cookie]
    Recheck --> Lease[Retained process lease]
    Lease --> Evidence[Unqualified connection evidence]
    Visibility[Proc and namespace visibility limits] -. constrain .-> Evidence
